<div class="space-y-4"><p>Send JSON with <code>event_id</code> (unique), <code>message_id</code> (Mailora message ULID), and <code>type</code>: delivered, hard_bounce, soft_bounce, or complaint.</p><div><strong>POST URL</strong><code class="block break-all">{{ route('feedback.receive',$endpoint->public_id) }}</code></div><div><strong>Signing secret</strong><code class="block break-all">{{ $endpoint->secret }}</code></div><p>Set X-Mailora-Timestamp to the current Unix timestamp. Set X-Mailora-Signature to the lowercase hexadecimal HMAC-SHA256 of <code>timestamp.raw_json_body</code> using this secret. Requests expire after five minutes. Store the secret securely.</p></div>
